    "title": "Exodus 34:6–7 — The Name God Proclaims",
    "intro": "This tour follows Exodus 34:6–7 in its own setting: Moses is hidden in the rock while God reveals his glory and declares his name. You’ll hear the passage’s rich portrait of mercy, patience, loyal love, and justice, then spend time with the difficult final line about “visiting” iniquity across generations.",
